 "_": [
  "Canonical vectors GENERATED FROM the frozen Node canonicalizer on",
  "2026-08-24, not written by hand and not copied from this Python",
  "implementation. The frozen host is the oracle: if the two disagree the",
  "port is wrong, and a vector written by the port would only prove the",
  "port agrees with itself.",
  "",
  "The cases exist to DISTINGUISH the hosts. 'astral member names beside",
  "BMP' is the one that matters most: RFC 8785 orders members by UTF-16",
  "code units, so U+1F600 sorts BEFORE U+E000 because it encodes as the",
  "surrogate pair D83D DE00. Python's sorted() orders by CODE POINTS and",
  "puts it last. A faithful-looking port would produce a different",
  "canonical form, a different digest, and a manager that disagrees with",
  "the frozen reference about what a document IS."
 ],
